{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0193Jf6TT6Hp4djLSm1kZVb6","type":"tool_result","content":"total 9944\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 user  wheel      288 Nov  4 18:48 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 18:48 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     3331 Nov  4 18:48 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   141788 Nov  4 18:48 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 18:48 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     1808 Nov  4 18:48 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 18:48 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 18:48 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel  4221846 Nov  4 18:48 scorer_in.npz\n\"\"\"Laya scorer helper. M: [n, 5, 1024] marker vectors (one per department option).\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np, torch\nDEPTS = [\"cards\", \"disputes\", \"transfers_topups\", \"fees_fx\", \"account_security\"]\ndef load(path):\n    d = np.load(path); return {k: d[k] for k in d.files}\ndef save(S, path):\n    np.savez(path, **S)\ndef gelu(x):\n    return 0.5 * x * (1 + torch.erf(torch.from_numpy(np.ascontiguousarray(x)) / np.sqrt(2)).numpy())\ndef logits(S, M):\n    mu = M.mean(-1, keepdims=True); var = M.var(-1, keepdims=True)\n    h = (M - mu) / np.sqrt(var + 1e-5) * S[\"ln_w\"] + S[\"ln_b\"]\n    z = (gelu(h @ S[\"W1\"] + S[\"b1\"]) @ S[\"W2\"] + S[\"b2\"])[..., 0]\n    i, e = 0, M\n    while f\"extra_W{i}\" in S:\n        e = e @ S[f\"extra_W{i}\"] + S[f\"extra_b{i}\"]\n        if f\"extra_W{i + 1}\" in S:\n            e = np.maximum(e, 0)\n        i += 1\n    return z + e[..., 0] if i else z\ndef predict(S, M):\n    return [DEPTS[i] for i in logits(S, M).argmax(-1)]\n\"\"\"Run frozen Laya on your own messages: python embed.py out.npz \"message 1\" \"message 2\" ...\nWrites M [n, 5, 1024]: the scorer input for each department option. Takes ~10 s to load.\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '<lab>/laya')\nimport numpy as np, laya_lab as L\na = L.load_agent()\nnp.savez(sys.argv[1], M=L.marker_vectors(a, sys.argv[2:]))\nprint(\"wrote\", sys.argv[1], len(sys.argv) - 2, \"messages\")\ntext\tcorrect\nCan someone assist me with explaining how I can unblock my pin?\tcards\nI have used all of my PIN tries. What should I do now?\tcards\nMy account is locked because I used the wrong pin too many times.  Please help.p\tcards\nHow can I change my PIN even though I'm out of the country in Austria at the moment?\tcards\nCan you tell me how to change my PIN?\tcards\nCan you unblock my blocked pin?\tcards\nCan I change my pin at ATMs?  If so, what ones?\tcards\nCan I reset my PIN?\tcards\n\nI put the wrong pin too many times and now it is blocked. Can you help me unblock it?\tcards\nHow many times can I enter a wrong PIN before it is blocked?\tcards\nI may have entered the PIN wrong and the account is blocked.  What do I have to do to get it unblocked.\tcards\nWhere do I go to unblock my PIN?\tcards\nWhere am I able to get my PIN unblocked?\tcards\nCan my PIN be changed in any cash machine?\tcards\nChanging my PIN\tcards\nI accidentally exceeded my PIN tries.  Please advise.\tcards\nWhat is the delivery time for US?\tcards\nWhere do you export the cards to?\tcards\nI want to start using my card.\tcards\nWhat do I do now that I can't use this card?\tcards\nHow long is a delivery to the US?\tcards\nCan I revive a physical card.\tcards\nCan I pick between Visa and Mastercard?\tcards\nDo you know the process how to activate my card?\tcards\nWhat is the maximum transactions I can use on a disposable card?\tcards\nHow much would an extra card cost?\tcards\nDo you give out Visa or Mastercards?\tcards\nI haven't received the PIN yet.\tcards\nCan I already use my account although the identity verification has not passed yet?\taccount_security\nCan I call to get my card activated?\tcards\nWho can purchase a disposable virtual card?\tcards\nI need to order a new card as my old one will expire soon. Can you tell me how to order a new one?\tcards","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"